  "text": " You're getting mandated to get a 5-alien booster here and your staff and the faculty here who are at risk, who are maybe advanced in age, are not. Your university is putting your life in danger. You do not need another booster for a COVID-19 vaccine that has been understudied and maybe damaging to your health. I cannot believe that in the year 2022, I'm standing here to say Yale University should not mandate 17-year-olds, 18-year-olds, 19-year-olds, 20-year-olds, 21-year-olds with an experimental, dangerous mRNA, lipid nanoparticle injection just so they can come back to school. They are fully aware of the effects of the vaccine. They are fully aware of what they are doing. They don't care. In January of this year, I was cancelled from the university along with $23,000 of marriage scholarships, which I had earned through a lifetime of education and hard work. And the call to action here today is that college students here at Yale and around the country, you know, I can't do this for you. You have to go out and take action. You're the ones that need to speak out. You need to refuse to comply with booster shots first. This ain't going to do it. What's going to do it is what Phoebe was talking about, when the actual students themselves stand up and say, we're not taking this anymore. Well, let's put them on notice today that they are no longer the top. They are no longer the top of the heap. They are now below the bottom because what they have tempted to do is to partner with the evil. And like Trish said, this is a fight. This is a fight. This is a fight against evil.",
